# Animation Pipeline

Coming soon — this page explains Reactor's animation pipeline
end-to-end: the four animation systems (implicit, compositor, layout,
keyframes) and which one runs on which thread, the
5-compositor-property ceiling, `WithAnimation` ambient scope
mechanics, and the enter/exit machinery behind `.Transition()`. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Animation](animation.md) covers the surface modifiers.
